1
00:00:01,569 --> 00:00:02,876
As Uke strikes

2
00:00:02,877 --> 00:00:05,533
slide forward, one arm controls his wrist,

3
00:00:05,534 --> 00:00:07,874
the other one towards Uke´s face for the atemi

4
00:00:07,875 --> 00:00:09,511
control the wrist and elbow

5
00:00:09,512 --> 00:00:11,347
enter deeply behind Uke,

6
00:00:11,348 --> 00:00:13,329
turning, cutting down in front of you, 

7
00:00:13,330 --> 00:00:14,562
maintain your extension

8
00:00:15,163 --> 00:00:17,155
put Uke´s arm down strait

9
00:00:17,156 --> 00:00:19,410
apply pressure to the back of the elbow,

10
00:00:20,411 --> 00:00:23,275
raise Uke´s elbow pushing the wrist underneath

11
00:00:23,976 --> 00:00:26,301
apply pressure to the elbow for the pin.

